<title>SRI LANKA: Dankotuwa 3-month net little changed.</title>
<headline>Dankotuwa 3-month net little changed.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Dankotuwa Porcelain Ltd for the three months ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			     1997	    1996</p>
<p>    Turnover	    136.12   vs   126.76</p>
<p>    Net profit	   24.49   vs    25.23</p>
<p>    Tax		     2.49   vs	--</p>
<p>NOTE - Dankotuwa Porcelain manufactures tableware, mainly for export.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
